{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】蔡天鳳碎屍案續審。</p>\n<p>庭上播放多條閉路電視片段，顯示鄺球在案發前戴著口罩在一間電器店購買了一個二手雪櫃，而鄺港傑則在一間五金店購入一把鎚仔及牛皮膠紙等，期間向店員作出敲打的手勢。閉路電視片段亦顯示，鄺港傑及鄺港智在案發當日曾在一間咖啡店會面。</p>\n<p>今日下午會由警員吳太盛繼續作供。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:20:29.164883+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:12:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:58:49.569531+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:18:09.021211+00:00","content_hash":"20bc1bd69ca8c7c715b1d0624bf263f7b79b5606f29ef14facd22fe164554ade","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:20:29.164883+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}